msgstr "VISIBILITY"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/base_options.rst:10
msgid ""
"For setting cloud permissions in a multi-tenant environment. Not applicable "
"in single tenant environments."
msgstr ""
"For setting cloud permisos in un multi-tenant entorno. Not applicable in "
"único tenant entornos."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/base_options.rst:11
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:56
msgid "TENANT"
msgstr "TENANT"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/base_options.rst:12
msgid ""
"If Visibility is set to Private, select the Tenant the Cloud resources will "
"assigned to."
msgstr ""
"If Visibility es set to Private, select el Tenant el Cloud recursos será "
"assigned to."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/base_options.rst:13
msgid "ENABLED"
msgstr "ENABLED"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/base_options.rst:14
msgid ""
"When disabled, automatic Cloud sync is paused and the Cloud will not be "
"selectable for provisioning."
msgstr ""
"When deshabilitado, automático Cloud sync es paused y el Cloud no be "
"selectable para provisioning."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/base_options.rst:18
msgid "AUTOMATICALLY POWER ON VMS"
msgstr "AUTOMATICALLY POWER ON VMS"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/base_options.rst:16
msgid ""
"When enabled, |morpheus| will maintain the expected power state of managed "
"VMs. |morpheus| will power on any managed VMs in the Cloud that have been "
"shut down for unknown reasons (not powered off by |morpheus|) to ensure "
"availability of services."
msgstr ""
"When habilitado, |morpheus| será maintain el expected power state of managed"
" VMs. |morpheus| será power on cualquier managed VMs in el Cloud que tienen "
"sido shut down para unknown reasons (no powered off by |morpheus|) to ensure"
" availability of servicios."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/base_options.rst:18
msgid ""
"When \"AUTOMATICALLY POWER ON VMS\" is enabled, the power state of managed "
"VMs should be maintained in |morpheus|. This setting is not applicable to "
"discovered/unmanaged resources."
msgstr ""
"When \"AUTOMATICALLY POWER ON VMS\" es habilitado, el power state of managed"
" VMs debería be maintained in |morpheus|. This setting no es applicable to "
"discovered/unmanaged recursos."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:35
msgid "**Details**"
msgstr "**Details**"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:37
msgid ""
"Authenticating a new vCD Cloud requires either a username and password "
"combination OR an API token and Tenant. You do not need both despite the "
"fact that all four of those fields are indicated as required fields."
msgstr ""
"Authenticating un nuevo vCD Cloud requires either un usuarioname y "
"contraseña combination OR un API token y Tenant. You no need both despite el"
" fact que todos four of esos campos son indicated as requerido campos."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:40
msgid "API URL"
msgstr "API URL"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:40
msgid "vCloud Director API Url"
msgstr "vCloud Director API Url"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:41
msgid "Example: ``https://org.vcd.company.com``"
msgstr "Example: ``https://org.vcd.company.com``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:42
msgid "CREDENTIALS"
msgstr "CREDENTIALS"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:43
msgid ""
"Authenticating a new vCD Cloud requires either a username and password "
"combination OR an API token and Tenant. These may be locally entered (select"
" Local Credentials), locally entered and stored securely for future use "
"(select \"username and password\" or \"api token, tenant\" from within the "
"\"New Credentials\" section), or a pre-existing credential set may be "
"selected from the |morpheus| secure credential store. Depending on the "
"selection, additional fields will appear (or some may disappear) to "
"facilitate your choice"
msgstr ""
"Authenticating un nuevo vCD Cloud requires either un usuarioname y "
"contraseña combination OR un API token y Tenant. These puede be locally "
"entered (select Local Credentials), locally entered y stored securely para "
"future use (select \"nombre de usuario y contraseña\" o \"api token, "
"tenant\" desde dentro de el \"New Credentials\" sección), o un pre-existente"
" credential set puede be seleccionado desde el |morpheus| secure credential "
"store. Dependiendo de el selection, adicional campos será appear (o algunos "
"puede disappear) to facilitate your choice"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:50
msgid "USERNAME"
msgstr "USERNAME"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:45
msgid "vCD Organization Administrator or System Administrator User"
msgstr "vCD Organization Administrator o System Administrator User"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:47
msgid ""
"User must have an Organizational Administrator or System Administrator Role"
msgstr ""
"User debe tienen un Organizational Administrator o System Administrator Role"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:48
msgid "Username must be in the format of <name>@<org>"
msgstr "Username debe be in el formato of <nombre>@<org>"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:49
msgid ""
"When using a user with the System Administrator role, give the username in "
"the format of <username>@system. Additionally, ensure this user has "
"permission set correctly, such as to view objects created by the "
"organization administrator if needed. Otherwise, things like catalogs and "
"vApps created by the Organization Administrator might not be visible to "
"|morpheus|"
msgstr ""
"When using un usuario con el System Administrator role, give el usuarioname "
"in el formato of <nombre de usuario>@sistema. Adicionalmente, ensure este "
"user tiene permiso set correctly, como to view objetos creado by el "
"organization administrator si es necesario. De lo contrario, things like "
"catalogs y vApps creado by el Organization Administrator might no be visible"
" to |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:50
msgid ""
"In some cases, it may not be advisable to use the system administrator user."
" This is because some environments will have API access turned off for the "
"system administrator for security reasons as the user would be able to "
"remove key pieces of infrastructure. If your system administrator user does "
"have API access and you understand the risks, you can authenticate "
"|morpheus| with this user"
msgstr ""
"In algunos cases, it no puede be advisable to use el sistema administrator "
"user. This es porque algunos entornos será tienen API acceso turned off para"
" el sistema administrator para security reasons as el usuario sería be able "
"to remove key pieces of infrastructure. If your sistema administrator user "
"does tienen API acceso y you understand el risks, you puede authenticate "
"|morpheus| con este user"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:52
msgid "PASSWORD"
msgstr "PASSWORD"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:53
msgid "Password for the user indicated above"
msgstr "Password para el usuario indicated anterior"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:54
msgid "API TOKEN"
msgstr "API TOKEN"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:55
msgid "A generated API token for the service account user"
msgstr "A generated API token para el servicio cuenta user"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:57
msgid "The Tenant to which the service account user authenticates"
msgstr "The Tenant to cual el servicio cuenta user authenticates"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:58
msgid "ORG"
msgstr "ORG"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:59
msgid "Select Organization. Dropdown populates upon successful authorization."
msgstr "Select Organization. Dropdown populates sobre exitoso authorization."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:60
msgid "VDC"
msgstr "VDC"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:61
msgid "Select VDC. Dropdown populates upon successful authorization."
msgstr "Select VDC. Dropdown populates sobre exitoso authorization."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:62
msgid "API VERSION"
msgstr "API VERSION"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:63
msgid ""
"Full version required which much be in the \"xx.x\" format. When applicable,"
" do not drop a trailing \"0\" (Ex. ``31.0``). |morpheus| will attempt to "
"discover the API version, which would make this field optional. However, vCD"
" allows disabling of the API versions API. In such an environment, the user "
"would need to specify the API version here"
msgstr ""
"Full versión requerido cual much be in el \"xx.x\" formato. When applicable,"
" no drop un trailing \"0\" (Ex. ``31.0``). |morpheus| será attempt to "
"discover el API versión, cual sería make este campo opcional. Sin embargo, "
"vCD allows disabling of el API versions API. In such un entorno, el usuario "
"sería need to specify el API versión aquí"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:64
msgid "CATALOG"
msgstr "CATALOG"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:65
msgid ""
"Optionally select a vCD catalog to store |morpheus| artifacts or use the "
"default \"morpheus_auto\" catalog"
msgstr ""
"Opcionalmente select un vCD catalog to store |morpheus| artifacts o use el "
"predeterminado \"morpheus_auto\" catalog"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:66
msgid "Inventory Existing Instances"
msgstr "Inventory Existing Instances"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:67
msgid ""
"If enabled, existing Virtual Machines will be inventoried and appear as "
"unmanaged Virtual Machines in |morpheus|"
msgstr ""
"If habilitado, existente Virtual Machines será be inventoried y appear as "
"unmanaged Virtual Machines in |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:69
msgid "Enable Hypervisor Console"
msgstr "Enable Hypervisor Console"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/vclouddirector.rst:69
msgid ""
"Mark to use VNC hypervisor console for the |morpheus| console rather than "
"the default SSH or RDP connection methods"
msgstr ""
"Mark to use VNC hypervisor console para el |morpheus| console rather than el"
" predeterminado SSH o RDP conexión methods"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:1
msgid "**Advanced Options**"
msgstr "**Advanced Options**"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:3
msgid "DOMAIN"
msgstr "DOMAIN"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:4
msgid "Specify a default domain for instances provisioned to this Cloud."
msgstr ""
"Specify un predeterminado domain para instances provisioned to este Cloud."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:5
msgid "SCALE PRIORITY"
msgstr "SCALE PRIORITY"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:6
msgid ""
"Only affects Docker Provisioning. Specifies the priority with which an "
"instance will scale into the cloud. A lower priority number means this cloud"
" integration will take scale precedence over other cloud integrations in the"
" group."
msgstr ""
"Only affects Docker Provisioning. Specifies el priority con cual una "
"instancia será scale en la nube. A lower priority número means esta nube "
"integration será take scale precedence over otro cloud integrations in el "
"grupo."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:7
msgid "APPLIANCE URL"
msgstr "APPLIANCE URL"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:8
msgid ""
"Alternate Appliance url for scenarios when the default Appliance URL "
"(configured in `admin > settings`) is not reachable or resolvable for "
"Instances provisioned in this cloud. The Appliance URL is used for Agent "
"install and reporting."
msgstr ""
"Alternate Appliance url para scenarios cuando el predeterminado Appliance "
"URL (configurado in `admin > configuración`) no es reachable o resolvable "
"para Instances provisioned in esta nube. The Appliance URL se utiliza para "
"Agent install y reporting."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:9
msgid "TIME ZONE"
msgstr "TIME ZONE"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:10
msgid "Configures the time zone on provisioned VM's if necessary."
msgstr "Configures el time zone on provisioned VM's si es necesario."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:11
msgid "DATACENTER ID"
msgstr "DATACENTER ID"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:12
msgid ""
"Used for differentiating pricing among multiple datacenters. Leave blank "
"unless prices are properly configured."
msgstr ""
"Used para differentiating pricing among múltiples datacenters. Leave blank "
"unless prices son properly configurado."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:13
msgid "NETWORK MODE"
msgstr "NETWORK MODE"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:14
msgid "Unmanaged or select a Network Integration (NSX, ACI etc)"
msgstr "Unmanaged o select un Network Integration (NSX, ACI etc)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:15
msgid "LOCAL FIREWALL"
msgstr "LOCAL FIREWALL"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:16
msgid ""
"On or Off. Enable to managed Host and VM firewall/IP Table rules (linux "
"only)"
msgstr ""
"On o Off. Enable to managed Host y VM firewall/IP Table rules (linux solo)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:17
msgid "SECURITY SERVER"
msgstr "SECURITY SERVER"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:18
msgid ""
"Security Server setting is for Security Service Integrations such as ACI"
msgstr ""
"Security Server setting es para Security Service Integrations como ACI"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:19
msgid "TRUST PROVIDER"
msgstr "TRUST PROVIDER"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:20
msgid "Select Internal (Morpheus) or an existing Trust Provider Integration"
msgstr "Select Internal (Morpheus) o un existente Trust Provider Integration"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:21
msgid "STORAGE MODE"
msgstr "STORAGE MODE"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:22
msgid "Single Disk, LVM or Clustered"
msgstr "Single Disk, LVM o Clustered"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:23
msgid "BACKUP PROVIDER"
msgstr "BACKUP PROVIDER"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:24
msgid ""
"Select a backup provider. Depending on the Cloud type and any currently-"
"configured backup plugins you may select Internal Backups (Morpheus) or "
"another configured backup solution"
msgstr ""
"Select un backup proveedor. Dependiendo de el Cloud tipo y cualquier "
"actualmente-configurado backup plugins you puede select Internal Backups "
"(Morpheus) o another configurado backup solution"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:25
msgid "REPLICATION PROVIDER"
msgstr "REPLICATION PROVIDER"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:26
msgid ""
"Sets the default Replication Provider for the Cloud. Select an existing "
"Replication Provider Integration"
msgstr ""
"Sets el predeterminado Replication Provider para el Cloud. Select un "
"existente Replication Provider Integration"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:27
msgid "GUIDANCE"
msgstr "GUIDANCE"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:28
msgid "Enable Guidance recommendations on cloud resources."
msgstr "Enable Guidance recommendations on cloud recursos."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:29
msgid "COSTING"
msgstr "COSTING"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:30
msgid ""
"Enable for |morpheus| to sync Costing data from the Cloud provider, when "
"available. For on-prem Clouds, enabling costing activates a costing service "
"designed to mirror the live costing experience of public clouds, including "
"invoicing with line items and real-time cost data (Operations > Costing > "
"Invoices). If your organization utilizes reserved instances and you want to "
"pull in related pricing data, some Cloud integrations include the option to "
"select `Costing and Reservations`. If this is not relevant, select `Costing`"
" to save money on additional calls to the Cloud provider's costing API."
msgstr ""
"Enable para |morpheus| to sync Costing datos desde el Cloud proveedor, "
"cuando disponible. For on-prem Clouds, enabling costing activates un costing"
" servicio designed to mirror el live costing experience of público clouds, "
"including invoicing con line elementos y real-time cost datos (Operations > "
"Costing > Invoices). If your organization utilizes reserved instances y you "
"want to pull in related pricing datos, algunos Cloud integrations include el"
" opción to select `Costing y Reservations`. If este no es relevante, select "
"`Costing` to save money on adicional calls to el Cloud proveedor's costing "
"API."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:31
msgid "DNS INTEGRATION"
msgstr "DNS INTEGRATION"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:32
msgid ""
"Records for instances provisioned in this cloud will be added to selected "
"DNS integration."
msgstr ""
"Records para instances provisioned in esta nube será be agregado to "
"seleccionado DNS integration."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:33
msgid "SERVICE REGISTRY"
msgstr "SERVICE REGISTRY"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:34
msgid ""
"Services for instances provisioned in this cloud will be added to selected "
"Service Registry integration."
msgstr ""
"Services para instances provisioned in esta nube será be agregado to "
"seleccionado Service Registry integration."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:35
msgid "CONFIG MANAGEMENT"
msgstr "CONFIG MANAGEMENT"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:36
msgid ""
"Select a Chef, Ansible or Puppet integration to be used with this Cloud."
msgstr ""
"Select un Chef, Ansible o Puppet integration to be used con este Cloud."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:37
msgid "CMDB"
msgstr "CMDB"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:38
msgid "Select CMDB Integration to automatically update selected CMDB."
msgstr "Select CMDB Integration to automáticamente update seleccionado CMDB."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:39
msgid "CMDB DISCOVERY"
msgstr "CMDB DISCOVERY"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:40
msgid ""
"When checked, any automatically discovered (unmanaged) servers onboarded "
"into |morpheus| from this Cloud will also have CMDB records created for "
"them."
msgstr ""
"When checked, cualquier automáticamente discovered (unmanaged) servers "
"onboarded en |morpheus| desde este Cloud será también tienen CMDB registros "
"creado para them."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:41
msgid "CHANGE MANAGEMENT"
msgstr "CHANGE MANAGEMENT"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:42
msgid ""
"Select an existing Change Management Integration to set on the Cloud. ex: "
"Cherwell"
msgstr ""
"Select un existente Change Management Integration to set on el Cloud. ex: "
"Cherwell"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:44
msgid "AGENT INSTALL MODE"
msgstr "AGENT INSTALL MODE"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:44
msgid ""
"SSH / WINRM / Guest Execution: |morpheus| will attempt to use SSH, WINRM or "
"Guest Execution for Agent install."
msgstr ""
"SSH / WINRM / Guest Execution: |morpheus| será attempt to use SSH, WINRM o "
"Guest Execution para Agent install."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:45
msgid ""
"Cloud Init / Unattend (when available): (DEFAULT) |morpheus| will utilize "
"Cloud-Init or Cloudbase-Init for agent install when provisioning images with"
" Cloud-Init/Cloudbase-Init installed. |morpheus| will fall back on SSH or "
"WINRM if cloud-init is not installed on the provisioned image. Morpheus will"
" also add Agent installation to Windows unattend.xml data when performing "
"Guest Customizations or utilizing syspreped images."
msgstr ""
"Cloud Init / Unattend (cuando disponible): (DEFAULT) |morpheus| será utilize"
" Cloud-Init o Cloudbase-Init para agent install cuando provisioning images "
"con Cloud-Init/Cloudbase-Init instalado. |morpheus| será fall back on SSH o "
"WINRM if cloud-init no es instalado on el provisioned image. Morpheus será "
"también add Agent instalación to Windows unattend.xml datos cuando "
"performing Guest Customizations o utilizing syspreped images."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:48
