#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:82
msgid ""
"Please note once you connect |morpheus| to your vCD environment, it will "
"create a catalogue called Auto |morpheus|. This is a working catalogue and "
"is ignored by |morpheus| when searching for images, so any images in the "
"catalogue will not be synced into |morpheus|"
msgstr ""
"Please nota once you connect |morpheus| to your vCD entorno, it será create "
"un catalogue called Auto |morpheus|. This es un working catalogue y es "
"ignored by |morpheus| cuando searching para images, so cualquier images in "
"el catalogue no be synced en |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:84
msgid ""
"Open the catalogue and select the import template from vCenter and then "
"browse the data stores for your templates. Select your template and the type"
" in a new name and description then check the copy template into vCloud "
"director."
msgstr ""
"Open el catalogue y select el import template desde vCenter y entonces "
"browse el datos stores para your templates. Select your template y el tipo "
"in un nuevo nombre y descripción entonces check el copy template en vCloud "
"director."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:86
msgid ""
"Once you click ok the import process will begin. When the import has "
"completed the template will appear in |morpheus| within |LibVir|"
msgstr ""
"Once you click ok el import proceso será begin. When el import tiene "
"completed el template será appear in |morpheus| dentro de |LibVir|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vCloudDirector/creatingvcloud.rst:88
