"the filters to filter the virtual images by the vmware ( vmdk / ovf / ova) "
"type."
msgstr ""
"If el image no appear dentro de el virtual images you puede need to use el "
"filters to filter el virtual images by el vmware ( vmdk / ovf / ova) tipo."

